  "id": "filipino-chicken-salad",
  "name": "Filipino Chicken Salad",
  "subtitle": "Chilled chicken, macaroni, fruit, and crisp vegetables",
  "description": "A creamy chilled salad combining cooked chicken and macaroni with pineapple, raisins, fresh vegetables, and lightly sweetened seasoned mayonnaise.",
